                            <%= render partial: "shared/elements/filled_rating_star" , locals: { blank_star: false } %>
        </div>
        <p class="sr-only">5 out of 5 stars</p>

        <div class="prose prose-sm mt-4 max-w-none text-gray-500">
            <p>Blown away by how polished this icon pack is. Everything looks so consistent and each SVG is
                optimized out of the box so I can use it directly with confidence. It would take me several
                hours to create a single icon this good, so it's a steal at this price.</p>
            <div class="flex space-x-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
                <div class="flex-none py-2">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?ixlib=rb-=eyJhcHBfaWQiOjEyMDd9&auto=format&fit=facearea&facepad=8&w=256&h=256&q=80"
